multiflexi-mcp-server (0.1.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Port to mcp 2.0's lowlevel Server API: mcp.types moved to mcp_types,
    and the
    @app.list_resources()/read_resource()/list_tools()/call_tool()
    decorators were replaced by on_* callbacks passed to the Server
    constructor.

